#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:5
#: 4e89f27342244239967960164d8b222f
msgid "Wiki Infrastructure Overview"
msgstr "Wiki 基础设施概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:7
#: 36b40940ca5f4bf8b156a0a394e6c827
msgid ""
"The wiki is built using the static site generator `Sphinx "
"<http://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/stable/>`__ from source written in "
"`reStructured Text markup <http://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/stable/rest.html>`__"
" and hosted on `Github here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki>`__."
msgstr ""
"Wiki 使用静态网站生成器 `Sphinx <http://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/stable/>`__ 构建，源码以 "
"`reStructured Text 标记 <http://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/stable/rest.html>`__ "
"编写，托管在 `GitHub 此处 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:9
#: d8443b0a6f9e47018323a46902daae75
msgid "The wiki has several sections:"
msgstr "Wiki 包含多个章节："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:11
#: b2c5a78d857042408cf3c8ffec5d84b1
msgid ""
"`Common "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/common/source/docs>`__"
" holds pages that are common to all vehicles like the :ref:`Optional "
"Hardware <copter:common-optional-hardware>` section of the wikis.  The pages"
" all have the **common-** prefix and are stored in the "
"**/common/source/docs/** directory.  Common images are in the `images "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/images>`__ "
"directory.  Common configuration information for the Wiki Sphinx build is "
"stored in **/common_conf.py**."
msgstr ""
"`Common "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/common/source/docs>`__"
" 存放所有飞行器通用的页面，如各 wiki 的 :ref:`可选硬件 <copter:common-optional-hardware>` "
"章节。这些页面均以 **common-** 为前缀，存储在 **/common/source/docs/** 目录中。通用图片存放在 `images "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/images>`__ 目录中。Wiki"
" Sphinx 构建的通用配置信息存储在 **/common_conf.py** 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:12
#: 387b6574acda40968424f0300a5392c9
msgid ""
"Each vehicle or ground station has a separate folder in the repository (e.g."
" '/copter', '/plane') which contains its own source and configuration files "
"(**conf.py**).  Corresponding images are stored in the /images/ subfolder."
msgstr ""
"每个飞行器或地面站在仓库中都有独立的文件夹（如 "
"'/copter'、'/plane'），包含各自的源码和配置文件（**conf.py**）。对应的图片存放在 /images/ 子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:14
#: 1929cc7ac462494e815c931ff3cc3999
msgid ""
"The **update.py** build script copies the common topics into specified (in "
"source) target wikis directories and then build them."
msgstr "**update.py** 构建脚本将通用主题复制到源码中指定的目标 wiki 目录，然后进行构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:16
#: 1f4bb209782841efa35eba5bcee52325
msgid ""
"The **Vagrantfile** can be used by Vagrant to set up a local build "
"environment independent of your host system. (`Vagrant "
"<https://www.vagrantup.com>`__ is a software tool that allows for the quick "
"and automated  setup of a virtual machine on your host operating system). "
"This allows you to edit the source in your host computer but manage the "
"build inside Vagrant. You can also manually set up a build environment (just"
" inspect the Vagrantfile for dependencies)."
msgstr ""
"**Vagrantfile** 可供 Vagrant 用于建立独立于宿主系统的本地构建环境。（`Vagrant "
"<https://www.vagrantup.com>`__ "
"是一款允许在宿主操作系统上快速自动化创建虚拟机的软件工具）。这允许您在宿主电脑上编辑源码，在 Vagrant 内管理构建。也可手动设置构建环境（参考 "
"Vagrantfile 中的依赖项）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-infra-overview.rst:21
#: 70e2c4f2a7084660b136bdca6bc1cdcc
msgid ""
"The wikis use a `common theme "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/sphinx_rtd_theme>`__ that provides the top "
"menu bar."
msgstr ""
"各 wiki 使用统一 `主题 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/sphinx_rtd_theme>`__，提供顶部菜单栏。"
